ness_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","review_id":"ogenAtGBvICiWVd3FH5mKA","date":"2020-06-22T21:38:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9345934391021729,"text_excerpt":"Got takeout from restaurant during covid. The fritters were decent, reminded me of hush puppies with unique tomato sauce. I got the Bennachin Jambalaya which meat was cooked well with lot of rice. The spinach was my favorite. I could eat the spinach ever night, and I'm not big vegetable person. Would recommend if you wanted to try a fusion of west African and New Orleans. A little on the expensive side but worth trying!"},{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","review_id":"iOf9Punds9i6mlOyYxBJAQ","date":"2011-08-02T14:01:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9339008331298828,"text_excerpt":"Cute little BYOB restaurant in the quarter with lots of vegetarian choices! The service was a little slow but that seems to be expected at many places in town. I came here with a girlfriend on Friday night and it was busy but we didn't have to wait for a table. We both agreed that the plantains were to die for. They were very flavorful, a little sticky, and were cooked to perfection. I ordered the black eyed peas in a tomato and onion stew with coconut rice. You get a choice of mild, medium, or spicy and I went with the spicy or hot, I can't remember what they called it. The spice was hot but it didn't overwhelm the dish so if you like it spicy, go for it. the stew was amazing, hearty, ma..."},{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","review_id":"bJnQrX_ychsH0SjRDqFy7A","date":"2012-04-26T06:28:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326122999191284,"text_excerpt":"In regards to what an earlier reviewer said, they definitely took cards when I went there, so fear not, my fellow cash-hating friends! I have been trying to eat here for ages as I'm pescatarian and always searching for great veg-friendly places, and my friend brought me here as a surprise tonight so I was STOKED. This friend and I particularly like to gorge ourselves, so even though this was only the first of three stops we had planned for this night of feasting, we went ahead and ordered the below: -Steamed tilapia in ginger & garlic sauce over fried plantains, sauteed spinach, and coconut rice -Eggplant, mushrooms, and bean sprouts in a curry sauce over couscous -Extra side of coconut r..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","photo_id":"ZK23qsGLUiBLDz-0WjIv1Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZK23qsGLUiBLDz-0WjIv1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9239404797554016},{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","photo_id":"FMhqPf71vswOPwgp5bVFLw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FMhqPf71vswOPwgp5bVFLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.90718674659729},{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","photo_id":"BEEEpAsyaVQL0dFMXNc_WQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BEEEpAsyaVQL0dFMXNc_WQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9041608572006226},{"business_id":"k1yDRDZ4QCvNW9Wm9-IOaA","photo_id":"MIdjfmnam4QQe6CFIPShrA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MIdjfmnam4QQe6CFIPShrA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8716840147972107}]},"notebook_case":null}
